{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "结构化视图规则：文件族 → 段 → 行/列定义。本文件是纯数据，Go 侧不硬编码任何段名、列名、枚举取值或刻度常量。",
  "source": {
    "calibratedAt": "2026-10-03",
    "files": "取自 config/lists.json 与归档实测路径；files 支持 path.Match 通配（大小写不敏感）。",
    "independentDrop": "段名与列序由**真实归档**校准：etc/independent_drop.etc 首行 = 0 / 20 / 0 / 1000000×5 / 1×5 / 0 / 0 / -1 / 1（共 17 个 token），第 17 位为 1 时紧跟 [list]，与 pvfUtility 的 DropListRowData（17 字段）以及其内置注释 etc.json 的 [independent drop] 说明一致。",
    "sectionNameStyle": "section 一律写 ScriptElement.Section 的原样值（不带方括号），与 config/annotations.json 的写法一致（消费侧用 EqualFold 比较）。",
    "notAdopted": "86JP/PvfLib 无此结构，未采纳。"
  },
  "formats": [
    {
      "id": "independent_drop",
      "label": "独立掉落",
      "files": [
        "etc/independent_drop.etc"
      ],
      "notes": "第 3 列（掉落物品）仅在掉落方式 = 0 时有效；= 1 时改看 [list] 内联候选，= 2 时 [list] 内是外部文件编号。掉落方式 = 1 / 2 时本行与**紧跟其后的 [list]** 建立关联（links），界面上双击「掉落方式」格即可查看那份列表。【2026-10-03 实测】本客户端（110 版）etc/independent_drop.etc 共 1834 行：掉落方式 = 0 有 971 行、= 1 有 854 行、= 5 有 9 行（规则未定义该取值，界面按原样显示原值）；**没有任何 = 2 的行**，且 etc/independentdrop/ 目录下的 .etc 全是 0 字节空文件、也不存在 independentdrop.lst —— 即\"外部文件\"这一层在当前客户端没有数据可跟，故未实现跨文件解析。",
      "sections": [
        {
          "section": "independent drop",
          "label": "掉落配置行",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 17,
          "links": [
            {
              "column": 16,
              "displayColumn": 2,
              "when": ["1", "2"],
              "targetSection": "list",
              "title": "掉落候选"
            }
          ],
          "columns": [
            { "label": "类型", "type": "enum", "values": { "0": "怪物", "1": "APC" } },
            { "label": "怪物/APC", "type": "ref", "ref": "monster" },
            { "label": "掉落物品", "type": "ref", "ref": "equipment|stackable" },
            { "label": "难度1 掉落率", "type": "rate", "scale": 1000000 },
            { "label": "难度2 掉落率", "type": "rate", "scale": 1000000 },
            { "label": "难度3 掉落率", "type": "rate", "scale": 1000000 },
            { "label": "难度4 掉落率", "type": "rate", "scale": 1000000 },
            { "label": "难度5 掉落率", "type": "rate", "scale": 1000000 },
            { "label": "难度1 个数", "type": "int" },
            { "label": "难度2 个数", "type": "int" },
            { "label": "难度3 个数", "type": "int" },
            { "label": "难度4 个数", "type": "int" },
            { "label": "难度5 个数", "type": "int" },
            { "label": "等级下限", "type": "int" },
            { "label": "等级上限", "type": "int" },
            { "label": "职业限制", "type": "ref", "ref": "character", "noneValue": "-1" },
            { "label": "掉落方式", "type": "enum", "values": { "0": "单一物品", "1": "内联列表", "2": "外部文件" } }
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "list",
          "label": "掉落候选（物品 / 权重）",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 2,
          "maxOccurrences": 2000,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "物品", "type": "ref", "ref": "equipment|stackable" },
            { "label": "权重", "type": "int" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "dungeon drop rate balance",
          "label": "地下城掉落率平衡（本客户端未出现，保留以便其它版本）",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 1,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "数值", "type": "int" }
          ],
          "optional": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "equipment_upgrade_system",
      "label": "装备升级系统",
      "files": [
        "etc/equipmentupgradesystem.etc"
      ],
      "notes": "2026-10-06 按真实归档 etc/equipmentupgradesystem.etc（355 行）实测校准：**只纳入形状确定的段** —— 数据 token 数为偶数（能按 2 个一组切行）且有闭合标签。[min upgrade] / [min Separate] 无闭合标签（单值 1 token）、[card enchant need item] 每组 3 个数的中间位含义未确认 ⇒ 这三处**刻意不建**（宁可不显示，也不显示成错表）。外围的 [group] / [index] / [broad cast] / [show effect] 等仍是文本。",
      "sections": [
        {
          "section": "need item",
          "label": "升级所需材料",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 2,
          "maxOccurrences": 200,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "物品", "type": "ref", "ref": "equipment|stackable" },
            { "label": "数量", "type": "int" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "fusion need item",
          "label": "合成所需材料",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 2,
          "maxOccurrences": 200,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "物品", "type": "ref", "ref": "equipment|stackable" },
            { "label": "数量", "type": "int" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "addition need item",
          "label": "附加升级所需材料",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 2,
          "maxOccurrences": 200,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "物品", "type": "ref", "ref": "equipment|stackable" },
            { "label": "数量", "type": "int" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "add upgrade rate",
          "label": "追加升级成功率",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 2,
          "maxOccurrences": 200,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "等级", "type": "int" },
            { "label": "成功率（原始值，待确认是否百分比）", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "add separate rate",
          "label": "追加分解成功率",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 2,
          "maxOccurrences": 200,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "等级", "type": "int" },
            { "label": "分解成功率（原始值，待确认是否百分比）", "type": "text" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "itemshop",
      "label": "NPC 商店物品",
      "files": [
        "itemshop/(r)equipmentshop7.shp",
        "itemshop/*.shp"
      ],
      "notes": "2026-10-06 按真实归档实测校准：itemshop/*.shp 的 [item list] 是**纯物品 ID 列表**（实测 4 个文件：0 个 / 1 个 / 15 个 / 7 段各 15~22 个，**均无成对**），故按 1 token = 1 行。files 的第一项是实文件（开窗默认打开它），第二项通配覆盖其它商店。商店的外围段（[NPC] / [type] / [sell info] / [tab] / [message]）未建模，仍按文本显示。",
      "sections": [
        {
          "section": "item list",
          "label": "商店物品列表",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 1,
          "maxOccurrences": 200,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "物品", "type": "ref", "ref": "equipment|stackable" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "tab",
          "label": "商店条目（页签）",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 1,
          "maxOccurrences": 100,
          "optional": true,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "条目名", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "npc",
          "label": "归属 NPC",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 1,
          "maxOccurrences": 10,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "NPC", "type": "ref", "ref": "npc" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "type",
          "label": "商店类型",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 1,
          "maxOccurrences": 10,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "类型", "type": "text" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "section": "message",
          "label": "提示语",
          "kind": "table",
          "rowTokens": 1,
          "maxOccurrences": 10,
          "columns": [
            { "label": "提示语", "type": "text" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
